{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 14, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "天", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.3437347467010947, "source": "天", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.4423470353692043, "source": "天", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 2.1546649629174235, "source": "天", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.03688192726104, "source": "勝", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.4231762883809305, "source": "勝", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "子", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 0.6505875661411494, "source": "子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "子", "target": "父"}, {"weight": 1.3437347467010947, "source": "子", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 0.7841189587656721, "source": "王", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.170413319885563, "source": "王", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 2.170413319885563, "source": "王", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.03688192726104, "source": "愛", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8137383759468304, "source": "伐", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.6314168191528755, "source": "伐", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.324563999712821, "source": "伐", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 1.120591195386885, "source": "下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "下", "t